{"BLOCK0": {"hash": "274e5d4abe7073bc6193f2663c42be9df237fa9718accf621254fec7b83ce861", "html": "WORK / SYSTEMS CASE STUDIES", "inline": true}, "BLOCK1": {"hash": "921addd4546337351441bac876adda67384266be2fdf43d312056ea467ec4c9d", "html": "Problems that did not fit inside one layer.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK2": {"hash": "91007d3f3ac5a452eccb46d079113f5f3bf82ff26e479dc0e4b022f7c6ab6694", "html": "These case studies focus on the engineering path: what failed, which boundaries mattered, how the system was isolated, and what made the result verifiable.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK3": {"hash": "c6392df06422d6dd2fc5622c7034d318714146be2819014c61c885fff08e3f71", "html": "Embedded firmware / real-time audio / SIP-RTP", "inline": true}, "BLOCK4": {"hash": "60f001188de53f7fb9cda09f34235a99aba8b0fd7defe5355aaed38af1ac20fe", "html": "ESP32-S3 Connected Voice Device", "inline": true}, "BLOCK5": {"hash": "5ea4fa34fd702981a8198467b0487c45a4f2eed389b51b3bf6641d8723006535", "html": "Building and debugging a real-time voice device across firmware, codecs, audio timing, packet transport, PBX integration and hardware behavior.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK6": {"hash": "2cafcd958a56854fab5bc6f56ba0b3405dbe5a8ee252cd3184d5f5417cd57b58", "html": "SIP signaling / RTP media / distributed debugging", "inline": true}, "BLOCK7": {"hash": "551dc74a57183726ebc306412094c66662b9f63f17d775558d7b8110c862ab51", "html": "VoIP &amp; Real-Time Communications Infrastructure", "inline": true}, "BLOCK8": {"hash": "254b2d1a23d37c46d14a9da34e4af68b95ef48e747731f5b13e3b03e87a0c260", "html": "Building and debugging signaling, routing, media, endpoints and infrastructure around real-time communications rather than treating the PBX as the whole system.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK9": {"hash": "e1d500dbd3d4cf31541ab88ba638295198af1bf0a59c3580792a797ec6ef039a", "html": "Linux / Docker / secure ingress / operations", "inline": true}, "BLOCK10": {"hash": "59f37c3961ce708e0247f8c48e8e91f36bbf51851f5c2dddfbf3d145da7be874", "htm