he LOUP lifecycle model.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK20": {"hash": "ebe4d7668c017bbafb7d837fa111b483f48287e99aeee8746f2a374a0a3a9084", "html": "OTA Fleet Control Plane", "inline": true}, "BLOCK21": {"hash": "d308f6b8c39bf054eefdbdf82fcecb0c6e61396182b10f1c59b55331b59fbf15", "html": "ESP device fleet service with unique device credentials, immutable firmware artifacts, compatibility gates, rollout state and authenticated operator control.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK22": {"hash": "0f9b3620ad9a54c414160b073ac162bec67e1dbc93d3aa91128a9dd40048582a", "html": "Fimi Access", "inline": true}, "BLOCK23": {"hash": "0276a408c40fa8998c1b7b4f4671b2b4331ba823e458a4a5b328293b138b47c7", "html": "Browser infrastructure workspace built from a pinned Termix base with a custom Fimi brand layer, reproducible patch set, SSH agent integration and gateway access.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK24": {"hash": "06c85ff37596bc9dbc1555f505cd83ce4f7c65f8e9a4429232a8edfb8507dae0", "html": "Content Studio", "inline": true}, "BLOCK25": {"hash": "d8eeed21caf01bb5080b04a57dff889f5c4006e3b32b28f376681a264b0c3e1c", "html": "Self-hosted content operations platform for drafting, review, approval, scheduling, workspace isolation, audit history and durable AI generation workflows.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK26": {"hash": "b80218b992dfc06b0ae48542271d0b7802f8f8f4ef5893db96a5dda10c92aaf6", "html": "Social Publisher", "inline": true}, "BLOCK27": {"hash": "892be09745258708ca8c1a07be15f9e272df2d2bbc041bf03bfb594ca22cabcd", "html": "Dedicated publishing engine with scheduler, queue worker, PostgreSQL/Redis state, reproducible source pinning and restore-tested backups; external publishing remains deliberately disarmed until credentials are configured.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK28": {"hash": "b2192ce94bb4ba8de23e5d04f963ff7797f29a1507712ec4c39290cf487b77ae", "html": "Embedded &amp; Devices", "inline": true}, "BLOCK29": {"hash": "924faa8f141cf22a38b9a62d19f33a59bd6230f0bf7999abb49f90538d2dce8f", "html": "LOUP ESP32-S3 Connected Voice Device", "inline": true}, "BLOCK30": {"hash": "1b49dcc4333ef4cf4fcfb2a1808e9ebc606724c4b3a3b28a0a31d8d54a36812c", "html": "Custom ESP32-S3 voice device spanning codec bring-up, I2S audio, AEC, jitter/playout, SIP/RTP, e-paper UI, controls, provisioning and OTA.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK31": {"hash": "4737b28a133f017d88b81a737aeab80a00eeac816fd6df759ce60e9268a824c8", "html": "Pocket Dial", "inline": true}, "BLOCK32": {"hash": "f41d67ced282d2971bda67865ad9340c593908a96afb7eb789d0be53d8eb2669", "html": "A SIP registrar and PBX that runs on an ESP32-S3, with extension calling, peer-to-peer RTP, call features, web administration, optional LVGL UI and dual-OTA.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK33": {"hash": "cb3f5da822b693152a7c4dc41f4fd933a545b87f204eca6143f999e8821c50b9", "html": "ESP32 Command LLM", "inline": true}, "BLOCK34": {"hash": "cd828fc90caa86445675d9a8a25b619e9125e17cc1d42c830a0625085b3df3df", "html": "A 580K-parameter transformer trained from scratch to turn English and Spanish commands into GPIO, PWM and servo actions entirely on an ESP32-S3.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK35": {"hash": "0062b62606623e8033c9f42c6f1c9a24db9d4f7c5005d4da7bcc719940903a33", "html": "Fimi Cam ESP-IDF", "inline": true}, "BLOCK36": {"hash": "d6f188f5a2c5c0ac455dd82de8b6a76cb6b872fbd89ff9fe7ad3f138bf2fa05c", "html": "ESP32-S3 camera firmware with Wi-Fi bring-up, browser live view, MJPEG streaming and still-image capture for an OV2640-class camera board.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK37": {"hash": "599d6f9d93b5d8297a4d5b07c34dbc86b3cdf4b6c8a779736f6ad9724b5988c5", "html": "Infrastructure &amp; Operations", "inline": true}, "BLOCK38": {"hash": "59f37c3961ce708e0247f8c48e8e91f36bbf51851f5c2dddfbf3d145da7be874", "html": "Infrastructure Operations Platform", "inline": true}, "BLOCK39": {"hash": "216a9cbf80c50fbfc9455bb6e8234932672261428af9af26e27015b9aa1a03f1", "html": "Central service, deployment, policy, storage and execution control plane with RBAC, audit events, read-only command views and guarded host execution.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK40": {"hash": "8a4c47cbe9cd937b784bba8e61d45aa24431cf1525bc08e6c6877e11184c7a4e", "html": "Network Flow Visualization", "inline": true}, "BLOCK41": {"hash": "c8174ef2d3365e58050f66e2a675ce5ac64b14f0caa15d039ad296c3fe403369", "html": "Interactive topology and packet-path view that maps hosts, DNS, ingress, services and observed flows into drill-down network views.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK42": {"hash": "41ecd55fcad0218b3844afe8f01990a83bd4d1bbb2debe02504f080e3fd03de5", "html": "Caddy Gateway &amp; Secure Ingress", "inline": true}, "BLOCK43": {"hash": "7640d90c36c10154392d10a0576cc81c412103c1557a48a0cf4513b881be792e", "html": "Canonical L7 ingress joining Cloudflare Tunnel, Caddy, Authelia and Tailscale with per-service sessions, server-side credentials and private/public routes.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK44": {"hash": "e086f3ab8d37a3a5abde3a88040c61bc90bae122f5ace1a84cabfdbd17dc6399", "html": "Production Observability &amp; Alert Validation", "inline": true}, "BLOCK45": {"hash": "542c9cfb359226d45b76c35bfb39ae566923897676f62e6af0f24410de049bf6", "html": "Metrics, logs, probes and alerting validated by controlled failures instead of dashboard appearance alone.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK46": {"hash": "4ccfdabe03eb549ecf6a0ae3a1570dc0a881b777a9451f76809a7e5fa2e099cf", "html": "Central Secret Lifecycle / OpenBao", "inline": true}, "BLOCK47": {"hash": "bb82c44aca6e7af4df7ce4e064881ef92189d71c5b7a0322f0d2be2742c6c0a8", "html": "Two-tier OpenBao secret authority with Raft state, Transit auto-unseal, TLS, AppRole and a migration path away from filesystem secrets.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK48": {"hash": "a833e38fd41bb6bcbd1d5dc28ea381e5ecc9750df9ce0be9520a697caff8efa7", "html": "Disaster Recovery &amp; Restore Verification", "inline": true}, "BLOCK49": {"hash": "da67df2d2ec9bf7b8520c0bfc119ca6b2785c1d72de48e4c556eaff4e1d7fee2", "html": "Encrypted backup and recovery system spanning local rsync, off-site object storage, checksums and disposable restore verification rather than backup-success alone.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK50": {"hash": "80f3d74f2598fb8ff3c5949b094913ffffe4a529b0a508396b7d8de9038d472d", "html": "Private Alert Delivery", "inline": true}, "BLOCK51": {"hash": "5af548c3fa14d747eb9f293bffa38ec26d3afb7a0b2a267806ca0aae10ce4268", "html": "Self-hosted ntfy alert path from Alertmanager to a private Tailscale HTTPS endpoint with isolated publisher/subscriber identities and no public push dependency.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK52": {"hash": "5a6587babbbc37011792bad75bc38de5577dfb2d45472b3c73b8d69780ce1ded", "html": "Network Payload Capture Pipeline", "inline": true}, "BLOCK53": {"hash": "17a0db36a216e90804be898f9f0ee2f5500966a776dfc4d0a675551b06e6ada4", "html": "Minimal capability-bounded packet capture path that parses a live tcpdump stream into bounded payload snapshots consumed by the operations UI.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK54": {"hash": "939be504b7a5e54f333477dee509f4538ac89cca44ee61e2ca872c484bfe8267", "html": "Distributed Compute &amp; Build Fabric", "inline": true}, "BLOCK55": {"hash": "ca5c708d8a0d15193e06e6cd3ea35a539233a8979c8d2b2b2dc0f3f28a3f155e", "html": "Nomad-based compute path across multiple machines with deterministic build execution and fallback capacity rather than tying jobs to one workstation.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK56": {"hash": "012fdaedf143e9134749cd51f52e772ff6bc10c155aad98c8113ae2bc0a31a03", "html": "Voice &amp; Telecom", "inline": true}, "BLOCK57": {"hash": "551dc74a57183726ebc306412094c66662b9f63f17d775558d7b8110c862ab51", "html": "VoIP &amp; Real-Time Communications Infrastructure", "inline": true}, "BLOCK58": {"hash": "4ba036745beba35ee9957f866e70fae41d621f872887b1baab2f39f8f20a2e16", "html": "SIP/RTP infrastructure and debugging across endpoints, PBXs, routing, media, packet captures, NAT and service health.", "inline": true}, "BLOCK59": {"hash": "e81640723476681d0cf6db931792f82e7a7e1565d0d55b35abfebaf4b7c9991e", "html": "FIMI VoIP Protocol Demo", "inline": true